# API surface

- Routes are versioned under `/api/v1`. Each route has a documented OpenAPI operation via `@hono/zod-openapi`.
- Machine-readable spec: `GET /openapi.json`. Interactive docs: `GET /docs` when `OPENAPI_DOCS_ENABLED` is `true`.
- Use RFC 7807 `application/problem+json` for errors produced by this Worker (see `src/lib/problem.ts`).
